sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client
    participant API as Ingestion API
    participant Stream as Event Stream
    participant Orch as Moderation Orchestrator
    participant TextML as Text Inference
    participant VisionML as Vision Inference
    participant Policy as Policy Rule Engine
    participant Action as Action Executor
    participant Review as Reviewer Queue

    Client->>API: Submit Post (Text + Image)
    API->>Stream: Publish Submission Event
    API-->>Client: 202 Accepted
    Stream->>Orch: Consume Submission Event

    par ML Inference
        Orch->>TextML: Analyze Text Content
        TextML-->>Orch: Return Text Scores (Toxicity, Hate Speech)
    and
        Orch->>VisionML: Analyze Image Content
        VisionML-->>Orch: Return Vision Scores (NSFW, Violence)
    end

    Orch->>Policy: Evaluate Scores against Policies

    alt Score >= Auto-Action Threshold
        Policy->>Action: Trigger Auto-Delete / Down-rank
        Action-->>Policy: Action Executed
    else Score >= Review Threshold
        Policy->>Review: Enqueue for Human Review
        Review-->>Policy: Queued
    else Score < Review Threshold
        Policy-->>Orch: Approved (No Action)
    end

    Orch->>Stream: Publish Decision Event
